      en: ["The lagoon covers approximately 130 hectares", "Average water depth is about 1.5 meters", "Located next to the 6th-century BC ruins of Oricum", "Adjacent to the historic Pasha Liman naval base", "Key breeding ground for grey mullet and eel", "Set against the backdrop of the Ceraunian Mountains"],
