      en: ["Lake Ohrid reaches a maximum depth of 289 meters.", "The Albanian part of the lake covers approximately 110 square kilometers.", "UNESCO status was extended to include the Albanian side in 2019.", "The endemic 'Koran' trout is a culinary and cultural symbol of Pogradec.", "Approximately 50 percent of the lake's water comes from underwater springs.", "Remains of an early Christian basilica with mosaics were discovered in Lin."],
